note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"141fe1f1e15dc325\" href=\"?note=141fe1f1e15dc325\" title=\"67-df-degree-theory-operations\">67-df-degree-theory-operations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"89eac554f6aa8842\" href=\"?note=89eac554f6aa8842\" title=\"67-thm-degree-structure\">67-thm-degree-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"511859971a231477\" href=\"?note=511859971a231477\" title=\"67-df-degree-bounds\">67-df-degree-bounds</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"45559b2e50b02071\" href=\"?note=45559b2e50b02071\" title=\"67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization\">67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 7.1 and Lemma 7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>94</span><span>95</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>105</span><span>106</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"book-proof-read; Lemma 7.4 and Chapter 6 dependencies not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\leq_T,d_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>，偏序性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"89eac554f6aa8842\" href=\"?note=89eac554f6aa8842\" title=\"67-thm-degree-structure\">67-thm-degree-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}_T,\\mathrm{Sup}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Inf}_T,\\mathrm{Sup}_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"511859971a231477\" href=\"?note=511859971a231477\" title=\"67-df-degree-bounds\">67-df-degree-bounds</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_T,J_T\">\\(M_T,J_T\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"141fe1f1e15dc325\" href=\"?note=141fe1f1e15dc325\" title=\"67-df-degree-theory-operations\">67-df-degree-theory-operations</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\">\\(\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\)</span> 在下式定义； <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\">\\(A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\)</span> 在该集合中取值。所有度变量在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T\">\\(D_T\\)</span> 中取值。</li>\n<li>下式先断言所需界的唯一存在性，再定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\">\\(\\wedge_T,\\vee_T\\)</span>；不以代表元任意选择作为未证明的函数定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T):g[A]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\in D_T\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\ (d_T(A)=a),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\ \\bigl[\\exists!c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Inf}_T(\\{a,b\\},c)\\bigr]\n\\land\\bigl[\\exists!c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c)\\bigr],\\\\\na\\wedge_Tb&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Inf}_T(\\{a,b\\},c),\n&amp;a\\vee_Tb&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\\n[d_T(M_T(A,B))=d_T(A)\\wedge_Td_T(B)\\land\nd_T(J_T(A,B))=d_T(A)\\vee_Td_T(B)],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\\n[d_T(A)=d_T(A&#39;)\\land d_T(B)=d_T(B&#39;)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}d_T(M_T(A,B))=d_T(M_T(A&#39;,B&#39;))\\land\nd_T(J_T(A,B))=d_T(J_T(A&#39;,B&#39;))],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ (c\\leq_T(a\\wedge_Tb)\\leftrightarrow(c\\leq_Ta\\land c\\leq_Tb)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ ((a\\vee_Tb)\\leq_Tc\\leftrightarrow(a\\leq_Tc\\land b\\leq_Tc)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ (a\\wedge_T(b\\vee_Tc)=(a\\wedge_Tb)\\vee_T(a\\wedge_Tc)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ (a\\vee_T(b\\wedge_Tc)=(a\\vee_Tb)\\wedge_T(a\\vee_Tc)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}(T):g[A]\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a\\in D_T\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\ (d_T(A)=a),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b\\in D_T\\ \\bigl[\\exists!c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Inf}_T(\\{a,b\\},c)\\bigr]\n\\land\\bigl[\\exists!c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c)\\bigr],\\\\\na\\wedge_Tb&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Inf}_T(\\{a,b\\},c),\n&amp;a\\vee_Tb&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota c\\in D_T\\ \\mathrm{Sup}_T(\\{a,b\\},c),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\\n[d_T(M_T(A,B))=d_T(A)\\wedge_Td_T(B)\\land\nd_T(J_T(A,B))=d_T(A)\\vee_Td_T(B)],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A,B,A&#39;,B&#39;\\in\\mathsf{Ext}_{\\mathrm{PR}}(T)\\\n[d_T(A)=d_T(A&#39;)\\land d_T(B)=d_T(B&#39;)\\Longrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}d_T(M_T(A,B))=d_T(M_T(A&#39;,B&#39;))\\land\nd_T(J_T(A,B))=d_T(J_T(A&#39;,B&#39;))],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ (c\\leq_T(a\\wedge_Tb)\\leftrightarrow(c\\leq_Ta\\land c\\leq_Tb)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ ((a\\vee_Tb)\\leq_Tc\\leftrightarrow(a\\leq_Tc\\land b\\leq_Tc)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ (a\\wedge_T(b\\vee_Tc)=(a\\wedge_Tb)\\vee_T(a\\wedge_Tc)),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall a,b,c\\in D_T\\ (a\\vee_T(b\\wedge_Tc)=(a\\vee_Tb)\\wedge_T(a\\vee_Tc)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>对应原书第7章定理1（印刷95页，PDF106页），连同印刷94页引理1给出的交、并构造。原书不仅假定格存在，而是证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T\">\\(D_T\\)</span> 是分配格；旧文件“若是格则存在格运算”的条件重述未覆盖这个实质结论。</p>\n<p>代表元无关性：引理1的两组泛性质使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_T\">\\(M_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_T\">\\(J_T\\)</span> 分别给出唯一的最大下界和最小上界，故更换代表理论不改变所得度。已阅读原书定理1的证明：通过有限一致性句的析取/合取分配律比较两边理论。书中引理4的有限片段比较证明留给读者；本次未独立补证引理4及第6章全部辅助结果，因此标为来源陈述已核对，不能作为“证明链全部核验”的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-theory-operations","status":"resolved","id":"141fe1f1e15dc325","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-theory-operations]]","embed":false},{"tar