e_Tc)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D_T","display":false},{"tex":"M_T","display":false},{"tex":"J_T","display":false}],"bytes":3947,"backlinks":[{"id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"026bcae68c39ac6f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T,\\mathbf0_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"141fe1f1e15dc325","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"这些是理论上的构造。$d_T(M_T(A,B))$ 与 $d_T(J_T(A,B))$ 分别为度的交、并，其代表元无关性和格结论由 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]] 给出；不能直接把理论并集当成解释度的并。"},{"id":"d45c90153d8ba06e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\wedge_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"8f6dc4191c5f2e6c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T$ 及格运算 $\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"914bd719b3f82780","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]] 的固定基础理论及分配格运算。"},{"id":"846ef15b034c9318","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\vee_T$ 使用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]] 的同一基础理论与格运算。"},{"id":"56ca5a602e3a1728","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\mathbf0_T,\\mathbf1_T,<_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 采用 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"f2b5b6ad45b10aef","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 按 [[67-df-degree-structure]]，$\\wedge_T,\\vee_T$ 按 [[67-thm-interpretability-lattice]]。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"r